      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "search",
      "description": "Recessed cool silver search control with focus on the full enclosure.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"/></svg><input aria-label=\"Search contributions\" placeholder=\"Search contributions...\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#fcfcff;border:1px solid #bcc3de;border-radius:6px;width:285px;padding:10px 12px;color:#5d678f;box-shadow:inset 0 2px 3px #c0c6e020}.ds-search svg{flex-shrink:0}.ds-search input{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;width:100%;border:0;background:none;font-size:12px;color:#232940;min-width:0}.ds-search input:focus{outline:none}.ds-search:focus-within{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:2px}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:#586288}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-search{width:100%}}@media(max-width:580px){.ds-search input{font-size:16px}.ds-search input::placeholder{font-size:11px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-selected",
      "description": "Pale selected navigation row within the midnight navy rail.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-nav\" aria-current=\"page\" aria-label=\"Overview\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/></svg>Overview</button>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;width:100%;text-align:left;border:0;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:13px;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;background:#dee2ef;color:#1c2134;font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 2px 3px #0002;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav svg{color:var(--blue);flex-shrink:0}.ds-nav:hover{background:#dee2ef}.ds-primary:focus-visible,.ds-secondary:focus-visible,.ds-nav:focus-visible,.ds-stat:focus-visible,.ds-title:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:1000px){.ds-nav{font-size:0;padding:13px;justify-content:center;gap:0}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Read-only Progress Status",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-progress",
      "description": "GitHub source status displayed as an icon and label.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-status\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/></svg><span>In progress</span></span>",
      "css": ".ds-status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;border-radius:4px;padding:5px 7px;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10px;background:#ced3e7;color:#393f57;white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Active Metric Tile",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "metric-active",
      "description": "Violet active-work card, the strongest dashboard surface.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-stat\"><span class=\"ds-stat-label\">Active contributions</span><span class=\"ds-stat-value\">5</span><span class=\"ds-stat-note\">Across 4 repositories</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-stat{display:block;position:relative;text-align:left;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;background:var(--blue);color:white;border:1px solid var(--blue);border-radius:10px;padding:21px 22px 18px;min-height:158px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 #ffffff45;transition:background .15s;cursor:pointer}.ds-stat:hover{background:#6446c6}.ds-stat-label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#ece8ff}.ds-stat-value{display:block;font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-size:47px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;margin-top:13px;letter-spacing:-1.5px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-stat-note{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#ece8ff;margin-top:10px}.ds-primary:focus-visible,.ds-secondary:focus-visible,.ds-nav:focus-visible,.ds-stat:focus-visible,.ds-title:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:500px){.ds-stat{padding:15px 17px;min-height:88px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:center;border-radius:8px}.ds-stat-value{grid-column:2;grid-row:1/3;font-size:36px;margin:0}.ds-stat-label{font-size:11px}.ds-stat-note{font-size:9px;margin-top:5px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-stat{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Contribution Table",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "table",
      "description": "A calm ruled surface whose wide columns scroll inside the enclosure.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-table-scroll\"><table class=\"ds-table\"><thead><tr><th>Contribution</th><th>Repository</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><button class=\"ds-title\">Improve workflow validation</button></td><td>kestra-io/kestra</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
      "css": ".ds-table-scroll{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid #bdc3de;border-radius:8px;background:#fcfcff}.ds-table{width:100%;min-width:950px;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:var(--ink)}.ds-table th{font-size:10px;font-weight:500;padding:13px 17px;background:#dfe2ef;border-bottom:1px solid #c1c7e0;color:#4a5271}.ds-table td{padding:18px 17px;border-bottom:1px solid #dadeed;font-size:12px}.ds-table tbody tr:hover{background:#e8ebf4}.ds-title{display:block;max-width:310px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;padding:0;text-align:left;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#282d3e;line-height:1.6;background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-title:hover{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.ds-primary:focus-visible,.ds-secondary:focus-visible,.ds-nav:focus-visible,.ds-stat:focus-visible,.ds-title:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:500px){.ds-table-scroll{border-radius:6px}.ds-table th{padding:13px 14px}.ds-table td{padding:17px 14px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Chrome Branch Sculpture",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Approved transparent raster artwork reused in the header and cropped brand mark. Requires the shipped /art asset.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-sculpture\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/art/contribution-sculpture.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"140\"></div>",
      "css": ".ds-sculpture{position:relative;width:200px;height:140px;pointer-events:none;isolation:isolate}.ds-sculpture img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Tactile Contribution Workbench",
    "overview": "Nebula blends the selected Bauhaus and De Stijl geometry with tactile controls, an inflated violet tile, and liquid-chrome accents. A midnight navy rail anchors an cool silver working surface. Lilac appears sparingly in the brand punctuation and small sculptural bead; violet carries activity and action.\n\nThe working area stays calm: Syne gives headings and metrics a geometric voice, while DM Sans carries records and controls. Chrome is confined to the logo and header sculpture. This records the shipped implementation in app/workbench.css, its inherited foundations in app/globals.css, and app/page.tsx. PRODUCT.md and DIRECTION.md establish the authorized blended world and automatic GitHub workflow.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Midnight navy navigation, cool silver canvas, and concentrated violet activity.",
      "Geometric Syne headings with DM Sans task text.",
      "Tactile controls and chrome geometry around a calm ruled table.",
      "One cohesive visual world with responsive icon navigation."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Violet Action Rule",
        "body": "Use violet for primary actions, active filters, focus, and the active-work metric; reserve lilac for the observed small accents.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Task Type Rule",
        "body": "Use Syne for headings and metrics, and DM Sans for record content and controls.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Material Boundary Rule",
        "body": "Keep chrome and inflated geometry in the identity and header sculpture; use fine rules and restrained fills in the contribution table.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do retain labels and line icons alongside status colors.",
      "Do keep source fields visually distinct from editable workflow notes.",
      "Do contain horizontal overflow in the table and status filters.",
      "Do preserve mobile 16px entry fields and reduced-motion support."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't introduce a theme switcher; this is one blended visual world.",
      "Don't present GitHub status as an editable select or add manual contribution creation.",
      "Don't extend chrome ornament into data rows or replace the table with individually shadowed cards."
    ]
  }
}
